### Sadhaka API — manual requests
### Open in VS Code with the "REST Client" extension (humao.rest-client) and click
### "Send Request" above any block. No Postman install needed.
###
### Start the API first:  uvicorn api.main:app --reload --port 8000

@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000

### === system ===

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health


### === engine ===

### Trigger Run
POST {{baseUrl}}/run

### List Runs
GET {{baseUrl}}/runs


### === reporting ===

### Summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/summary

### Exceptions
GET {{baseUrl}}/exceptions

### Matches
GET {{baseUrl}}/matches

### Audit
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit

### Trace
GET {{baseUrl}}/trace/order_2012

### Gst
GET {{baseUrl}}/gst

### Scorecard
GET {{baseUrl}}/scorecard

### Forecast
GET {{baseUrl}}/forecast

### Journal
GET {{baseUrl}}/journal


### === reference ===

### Variance Codes
GET {{baseUrl}}/variance-codes

### Configuration
GET {{baseUrl}}/config


### === scenarios ===

### Marketplace
GET {{baseUrl}}/marketplace


### === verification ===

### Verification
GET {{baseUrl}}/verification

### Detection Limits
GET {{baseUrl}}/verification/detection-limits

### Calibration
GET {{baseUrl}}/verification/calibration

### Counterfactuals
GET {{baseUrl}}/verification/counterfactuals

### Run Verification Endpoint
POST {{baseUrl}}/verification/run

